        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden object game where you must find all the shells to complete the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖼️ 1 Large Hand-Drawn Watercolour Artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐌 100 Hidden Shells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 1 Achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 No Hints or Support for extra challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Zoom In/Out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 Relaxing music and background sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⌨️ Use only your Mouse or Mouse + Keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💾 Autosave. Pick up from where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗑️ Reset progress and play again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Context:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I lost my collection of 100 shells in the backyard. Can you help me find them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Left Mouse Button + Mouse Movement: Pan and Movement in the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Left Mouse Button  to  Collect Shells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Wheel for Zooming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD / Keyboard Arrows: Movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press ESC in-game to access the Pause Menu.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Immersed:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and dreamy metallophone music accompanied by the nonstop chirping of birds. Let loose of your inner child and go on a small adventure in the backyard.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden object game where you must find all the shells to complete the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖼️ 1 Large Hand-Drawn Watercolour Artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐌 100 Hidden Shells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 1 Achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 No Hints or Support for extra challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Zoom In/Out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 Relaxing music and background sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⌨️ Use only your Mouse or Mouse + Keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💾 Autosave. Pick up from where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗑️ Reset progress and play again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Context:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I lost my collection of 100 shells in the backyard. Can you help me find them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Left Mouse Button + Mouse Movement: Pan and Movement in the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Left Mouse Button  to  Collect Shells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Wheel for Zooming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD / Keyboard Arrows: Movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press ESC in-game to access the Pause Menu.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Immersed:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and dreamy metallophone music accompanied by the nonstop chirping of birds. Let loose of your inner child and go on a small adventure in the backyard.</p>",
